  "bodyHash": "184befcf8156fd54",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fwiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a> | <a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252ffaq\" rel=\"nofollow\">常见问题</a> | <a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fcredits\" rel=\"nofollow\">鸣谢</a></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>一款适用于 Minecraft 的近距离语音聊天模组，提供多种&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252faddons\" rel=\"nofollow\">附加组件</a>&nbsp;，以增加额外功能和特性。</p>\n<p>⚠️&nbsp;<strong>注意</strong>&nbsp;此模组需要在服务器上特别配置才能正常运行。&nbsp;请阅读&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fwiki%252fsetup\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>&nbsp;获取更多信息。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4dH2zwTmyX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_54aa599e-dca8-4985-ab3b-0c7eea6b093a.png\" width=\"300\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>如有疑问，请加入我们的 Discord 服务器！</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>下载</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat/files/all?filter-game-version=2020709689:10150\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/bukkit-plugins/simple-voice-chat/files/all\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bukkit/Spigot/Paper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:9153\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsimple-voice-chat%252fversions%253fl%253dvelocity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Velocity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsimple-voice-chat%252fversions%253fl%253dbungeecord\" rel=\"nofollow\">BungeeCord/Waterfall</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>按键说话 (PTT)</li>\n<li>声控激活</li>\n<li>近距离语音聊天</li>\n<li>密码保护的群组</li>\n<li>自动语音活动检测</li>\n<li>自动麦克风增益调节</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopus-codec.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Opus 编码</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjmvalin.ca%252fdemo%252frnnoise%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">RNNoise</a>&nbsp;循环神经网络降噪</li>\n<li>OpenAL 音频</li>\n<li>支持 Fabric、NeoForge、Forge、Quilt、Bukkit、Spigot 和 Paper 之间的跨平台兼容</li>\n<li>支持 Velocity、BungeeCord 和 Waterfall</li>\n<li>与&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>&nbsp;兼容（建议使用&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClothConfig</a>&nbsp;以获得更好的配置界面）</li>\n<li>可自定义按键说话键位</li>\n<li>麦克风和扬声器测试播放</li>\n<li>可自定义语音传输距离</li>\n<li>耳语模式</li>\n<li>单独调整玩家音量</li>\n<li>麦克风放大</li>\n<li>3D 空间音效</li>\n<li>AES 加密</li>\n<li>支持分离音轨的音频录制</li>\n<li>强大的&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fapi\" rel=\"nofollow\">API</a></li>\n<li>丰富的&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252faddons\" rel=\"nofollow\">附加组件</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">想要托管运行 Simple Voice Chat 的服务器？</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.bloom.host%252faff.php%253faff%253d2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://bloom.host/assets/images/Comp_2.gif\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">在此&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.bloom.host%252faff.php%253faff%253d2\" rel=\"nofollow\">租赁</a>&nbsp;您自己的语音聊天服务器</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">关于如何设置的更多信息&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.bloom.host%252fmultiplatform%252fsimple-voice-chat%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2>图标说明</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图标</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_f97b8585-e83d-497c-99f5-392cbc0ec617.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>你正在说话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_ce0aca93-3f5d-4780-af3c-ea67cacd2818.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>你正在耳语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_abb579d2-93c9-4b58-98fe-3af74640b927.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>玩家正在说话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_dbf0ec2c-2894-467f-a12b-783562b3d270.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>玩家正在耳语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_5c00868a-8177-4285-a834-f7f6182750f3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>麦克风已静音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_8ad963e4-d2c9-48ce-bbc5-86a560107b52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>语音聊天已禁用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_61dd79be-18cf-4c2a-b062-01a95f2b2159.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>语音聊天未连接<br>未安装语音聊天模组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>图形用户界面 (GUI)</h2>\n<p>按下&nbsp;<code>V</code>&nbsp;键即可打开语音聊天 GUI。在此界面中，您可以打开设置、管理群组聊天、静音自己、禁用语音聊天、开始/停止录音以及隐藏所有图标。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_c2a9809c-f4df-41a0-a0d2-dcf05ce9a32a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<h3>群组聊天</h3>\n<p>群组聊天允许您与不在您附近的玩家进行交谈。要打开群组聊天界面，您可以在语音聊天 GUI 中点击群组按钮，或直接按下&nbsp;<code>group</code>&nbsp;键。</p>\n<p>要创建新群组，只需在文本框中输入名称，然后点击底部按钮即可。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_d5f9b725-c5d3-4f21-84d9-4c2666f8cdce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p>创建或加入群组后，您将进入群组聊天界面。屏幕左上角还会显示群组成员的头像。正在说话的玩家头像会被高亮显示。您可以通过点击从左数第三个按钮来隐藏这些图标。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_e7b80129-1beb-4e61-ac59-53b45831481c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p>\n<p>未加入群组的玩家会在您的头像旁看到一个群组图标，以提示您正处于群组聊天中。</p>\n<p>您可以通过输入命令&nbsp;<code>/voicechat invite &lt;playername&gt;</code> 或在社交互动界面中邀请玩家加入您的群组聊天。</p>\n<h3>设置</h3>\n<p>按下&nbsp;<code>V</code>&nbsp;键并点击设置按钮即可访问语音聊天设置。</p>\n<p>该菜单提供了配置语音聊天音频设置的选项。</p>\n<p>点击麦克风按钮即可测试麦克风激活功能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_70d113bb-2d0e-4851-8098-1b63d97c81ce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<h2>重要提示</h2>\n<p>您需要在服务器上开放一个端口。默认情况下为&nbsp;<code>UDP</code>&nbsp;<code>24454</code>&nbsp;端口。如果不开放此端口，语音聊天将无法正常工作。您可以在服务器配置文件中更改此端口。更多信息&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fwiki%252fsetup\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>。</p>\n<p>语音聊天数据已加密，但我们不保证绝对安全。请谨慎使用，风险自负！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
